0.04 0.35 0.38 rg /F1 12 Tf 42 720 Td (10. Engineering disclaimers) Tj
0.10 0.22 0.24 rg /F3 8.5 Tf 42 700 Td (The machine health score is an adjustable engineering heuristic, not a certified safety) Tj
0.10 0.22 0.24 rg /F3 8.5 Tf 42 686 Td (metric. SHAP values describe which features contributed most strongly to a model prediction;) Tj
0.10 0.22 0.24 rg /F3 8.5 Tf 42 672 Td (they do not prove physical causation. Adaptive VMD optimization is measured by the) Tj
